# Trusts Guide

Comprehensive guide to trust planning, creation, and administration. This page provides an overview with links to detailed sub-topics.

## Quick Reference

**Purpose**: Estate planning, asset protection, wealth transfer, tax planning  
**Scope**: Revocable, irrevocable, and special purpose trusts  
**Jurisdiction**: Primarily US federal and state trust law

## Trust Fundamentals

- [[trust-fundamentals]] - Core concepts, structure, and creation process
- [[trust-administration]] - Managing trusts as a trustee

## Types of Trusts

- [[revocable-living-trusts]] - Flexible trusts modifiable during lifetime
- [[irrevocable-trusts]] - Permanent trusts for asset protection
- [[special-purpose-trusts]] - Trusts for specific purposes (charitable, special needs)

